                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/brain/search",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "brain",
                    "search"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Run a hybrid (semantic + keyword) search across the knowledge sources indexed in your Company Brain and return the most relevant, ranked snippets with citations.\n\nResults are scoped to what the authenticated user can see: personal sources, plus any team and organization sources shared with them. Requires the Brain feature, which is available on the Pro and Enterprise plans. Each search consumes Gumloop credits."
              },
